
! ========================================================================
! FACETMAP | HIERARCHICAL BIG FIVE REFERENCE MODEL
! Annotated original Mplus input - original model statements retained.
! Purpose: reference model for comparing rival personality structures.
! Five broad latent factors (N E O A C) with secondary facet loadings,
! item-level HALO and RSET factors, and selected facet residual covariances.
! The full variable dictionary lists 77 pools of 6 items; USEVARIABLES
! selects 3 indicators per modeled facet. Item IDs refer to original data.
! IMPORTANT: comments describe existing syntax; they do not change it.
! Data file path is relative: set DATA FILE IS to your local data path.
! Verify data-sharing permission before posting respondent data publicly.
! ========================================================================


! ========================================================================
! 1 | PROJECT AND DATA
! Title and source data file.
! ========================================================================
Title: 


  DATA: 

  FILE IS facet_map.dat;


! ========================================================================
! 2 | ORIGINAL VARIABLE DICTIONARY AND ANALYSIS ITEMS
! NAMES ARE enumerates all raw data columns in their original order.
! Inline Y/N and descriptor notes are carried over from the source file.
! Only the subsequent USEVARIABLES list is used for this estimation.
! ========================================================================
