! ========================================================================
! 3 | ESTIMATION SETTINGS
! MODEL = NOCOV suppresses Mplus default latent covariance estimation.
! Residual facet covariances are instead explicitly specified below.
! ========================================================================
  ANALYSIS: 

  MODEL = NOCOV;
  
  

! ========================================================================
! 4 | LATENT MEASUREMENT AND STRUCTURAL SPECIFICATION
! BY declares a latent factor measured by indicators.
! In Mplus, @ fixes a parameter; * provides a free starting value.
! E.g., X@-1 is fixed at -1; X*-.2 starts at -.2 and is estimated.
! Cross-item BY statements permit selected secondary item loadings.
! Do not interpret a * start value as the final loading estimate.
! ========================================================================
  MODEL:



